365:   container-token scan and the personal-id substring check both read what the pinned CLI
366:   (`supabase ^2.110.0`) prints in status output. A CLI upgrade that changes that shape must
367:   re-prove the instrument. [T2]'s docker corroboration on the destructive path narrows the
368:   exposure; it does not remove it.
